<item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise as Tech Gains in Taiwan, Korea: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Cracks in AI Stocks Sink the Once Reliable Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>